```css

/* ============================================================
   悬浮窗: 各楼层的"正文之外那一大坨"
   走酒馆自己的显示管线渲染 -> 预设正则(折叠思维链/摘要/选项按钮)全部生效
   ============================================================ */

/* ★ 这一层整页都在沙箱 iframe / 预览框里: 整页禁止出滚动条 (那条丑的谷歌原生滚动条就是它出来的) */
html, body { overflow: hidden !important; scrollbar-width: none; margin: 0; background: transparent; }
html::-webkit-scrollbar, body::-webkit-scrollbar { width: 0 !important; height: 0 !important; display: none !important; }
.gv-panel, .gv-panel * { box-sizing: border-box; }
.gv-panel {
  position: fixed; top: 78px; right: 16px; z-index: 2147483000;
  width: 360px; height: auto; max-height: calc(100vh - 16px); min-width: 220px; min-height: 90px;
  display: flex; flex-direction: column; overflow: hidden;
  border-radius: 14px;
